# O3 — the owner's task 3: a Genus landing page from two links, opened in the browser by Workshop (docs: acceptance-tasks.md)
@timeout 1800
@stall 120
launch workshop
type Create a landing page for Genus, an independent cybersecurity research lab. Use this as the visual reference: https://styles.refero.design/style/fc84e9f0-2058-4a0a-8d26-9cc1ba84ec9c — white and green. Reproduce the reference exactly: the same fonts, the same layout, the same way. It should look like a really good clone of the reference. The copy is declarative and clean, and its philosophy is based on this article, read it first: https://jyn.dev/a-year-to-fix-security/ . Make it extremely good and polished. When it's done, open it locally in the browser.
waitturn 1800
snap turn1
mark protect-start
sleep 12
mark protect-end
line /exit
waitshell 30
